        "original_id": "2be2d538-5586-510b-99f3-40f4ab306b26",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: DC Comics, Fawcett Comics\n- People: Otto Binder, C. C. Beck\n- Characters: Black Adam, Captain Marvel\n- Products: The Marvel Family, Shazam!\n\nFacts:\n- DC Comics, Inc. is an American comic book publisher.\n- In 1945, Otto Binder and C. C. Beck created Black Adam as a one-shot villain for the first issue of Fawcett Comics' The Marvel Family comic book.\n- After DC Comics first licensed and then acquired the Fawcett Comics characters, DC Comics revived Black Adam as a recurring character.\n- DC Comics began publishing Captain Marvel and Marvel Family stories under the title Shazam!.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
