        "text": "Page: DC Comics. Sentence: DC Comics, Inc. is an American comic book publisher.\nPage: Black Adam. Sentence: Black Adam was created by Otto Binder and C. C. Beck in 1945 as a one-shot villain for the first issue of Fawcett Comics' \"The Marvel Family\" comic book; however, Black Adam was revived as a recurring character after DC Comics first licensed and then acquired the Fawcett characters and began publishing Captain Marvel/Marvel Family stories under the title \"Shazam!\"",
